{"id":"vod_sn_37643","vodId":"37643","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"奈克瑟斯奥特曼","name_cn":"奈克瑟斯奥特曼","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3bb770474890db6131cfca853b654193.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在遥远的未来，肆虐的异生兽给人类的安全带来了巨大的困扰，为了抵挡异兽的进攻，日本政府成立了防卫组织TLT，其中，夜袭队拥有着最强大的实力和最强劲的武器，是整个组织内部的中坚力量。　　然而，面对经过了进化的新型异生兽，夜袭队亦束手无策，在这个节骨眼上，光之巨人奈克瑟斯奥特曼和它的适能者姫矢准（桐岛优介 饰）出现了。在奈克瑟斯奥特曼创造出的美塔领域中，奥特曼和异兽之间展开了激烈的斗争。孤门一辉（川久保拓司 饰）是TLT里的新进成员，当他目睹了奈克瑟斯奥特曼强大的力量后，开始对奥特曼的起源和姬矢准的神秘过往产生了兴趣。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:54:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":38,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/a3Lu0mDJLF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/DuuD2W0D7g1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/a46ySjKSEi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/mDEnT1DWW01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Bw6yJZYcJh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/233NXW9DGE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/XfrWTgwXft1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/LE3EYpx0f21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HT3tkNuztf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/D061L9BZhQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/L7aPBHk1Kg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/yrZfLq0Rwq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/SC5VejGGDL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vE3rA0LTdp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.